    <summary>Zero-config AI context generation and code quality toolkit with Claude Code Agent Mode</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[
# PMAT - Pragmatic AI MCP Agent Toolkit

PMAT is a zero-configuration AI context generation system with extreme quality enforcement and Toyota Way standards. It provides both on-demand analysis and continuous background monitoring through Claude Code Agent Mode.

## Features

- **Claude Code Agent Mode**: Continuous quality monitoring integrated with Claude Code via MCP protocol
- **AI Context Generation**: Optimized for LLM workflows and AI-assisted development
- **Code Complexity Analysis**: McCabe cyclomatic & cognitive complexity with AST precision
- **Technical Debt Detection**: SATD (Self-Admitted Technical Debt) analysis with severity classification
- **Quality Gates**: Toyota Way ≤20 complexity enforcement with zero tolerance policy
- **Multi-Language Support**: 30+ languages via tree-sitter grammar support
- **Real-time Monitoring**: File system watching with instant quality feedback
- **Production Ready**: Systemd service deployment with health checks

## Quick Start

```
# Analyze code quality
pmat quality-gate --strict

# Generate AI context
pmat context

# Start Claude Code Agent Mode
pmat agent mcp-server
```

## Claude Code Integration

Configure PMAT as an MCP server in Claude Code settings:

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "pmat": {
      "command": "pmat",
      "args": ["agent", "mcp-server"],
      "env": {}
    }
  }
}
```

Built with ❤️ following Toyota Way principles by Pragmatic AI Labs.
]]></description>
    
